            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Shop Garden and Tree Pruning Tools in Carbondale, CO",
            "text": "<p>Tired of using dull tools that slow you down or leave rough cuts on your trees and shrubs? We get it—working with the wrong tree pruners or saws can turn a simple yard job into a chore. That’s why we’ve spent years bringing in the tools that work for our local conditions, from the dry summers to thick, woody overgrowth.</p><p>Rivendell Distribution carries everything from<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hand+Saws\" target=\"_blank\"> hand saws</a> for branch removal to<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Hedge+Shears\" target=\"_blank\"> hedge shears</a> and scissors for clean shaping, plus<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/long-handle-tools\" target=\"_blank\"> long handle tools</a> to help you reach tall spots without a ladder. You’ll also find<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Loppers\" target=\"_blank\"> loppers</a> for thicker cuts and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Snips\" target=\"_blank\"> snips</a> for finer detail work, all designed to make your next job faster and cleaner. We delivery throughout Carbondale and nearby areas so you can get the tools you need without making a trip.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
