    "section_accordions_xDeiqR": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_WEhTVR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do you prune a tree for beginners?",
            "text": "<p>Start by removing any dead, damaged, or crossed branches. Use clean, sharp tools like a bypass pruner for small limbs or a folding saw for anything thicker. Always make your cuts just outside the branch collar to help the tree heal. For higher branches, long handle tools or pole pruners are safer than climbing.</p><p>Seasonal cleanup is also important. Timing your cuts based on tree type and basic yard and tree care can make a big difference in overall health.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_BA96Pr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are electric pruning tools available at your hardware store in Carbondale?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we carry several battery-powered options for trimming tasks that need more power or reach. If you’re looking for an easier way to handle thicker stems or cut without hand fatigue, tools like the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/1-5-inch-cordless-electric-hand-pruner-and-accessories?_pos=2&_sid=9611277bb&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> 1.25-inch Cordless Electric Hand Pruner</a> are a great choice. We also have pole chain saws for tall shrubs and trees, along with handheld clippers for lighter work.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_czN6Mm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What kind of pruning tools do I need for basic garden work at home?",
            "text": "<p>We carry the following products to help with everyday pruning tasks around your home or garden. From trimming flowers to managing twigs and light overgrowth, these tools keep things simple and effective.</p><p>Common tool options include:</p><ul><li>Pruners, snips, and pruning shears for soft stems, herbs, and flowers</li><li>Shears for shaping bushes and plants</li><li>Pruning saws for thicker stems and woody plants</li><li>Hedge shears for trimming borders and shrubs</li><li>Hand tools for general garden cleanup</li><li>Anvil pruners for cutting dry or dead twigs and woody branches</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "text_rtUkF7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which tools work best for trimming tall trees without a ladder?",
            "text": "<p>Trimming tall trees doesn’t always require climbing. We carry<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/long-handle-tools\" target=\"_blank\"> long handle tools</a> and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Tree+Pruners\" target=\"_blank\"> tree pruners</a> that help you reach higher spots from the ground.<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/corona-dual-compound-action-tree-pruner-14-feet?_pos=1&_sid=f4ee0c800&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> The Corona Dual Compound Action Tree Pruner</a> and the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/long-reach-pole-epruner-99-5-inch?_pos=1&_sid=89d4f3977&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> Long Reach Pole ePruner 99.5-inch</a> are both excellent for tall branches. These tools are especially helpful for trimming trees in uneven ground like many areas around Carbondale, CO.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_QcDyz7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you carry pruning tools for fruit trees or orchard maintenance in Colorado?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we carry tools that work well for pruning fruit trees and orchard upkeep, especially in high-altitude areas like Carbondale. For clean, strong cuts, the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/corona-aluminum-handle-high-performance-orchard-lopper-32inch?_pos=1&_sid=37ad33814&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> Corona High-Performance Orchard Lopper</a> is a popular choice. For thicker limbs or seasonal cleanup, the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/corona-razortooth-folding-saw-10-inch-curved-blade?_pos=1&_sid=58ad0be78&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> Corona RazorTOOTH Folding Saw</a> is a reliable option. Our pruning tools section also includes long-reach and cordless tools for larger properties. We also stock similar tools suited for seasonal shaping, maintenance, and light structural cuts. These tools pair well with the changing seasons and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/blogs/news/tips-to-maintain-a-healthy-lawn-in-western-colorado\" target=\"_blank\"> tree and yard care in Western Colorado</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_PgeKF8": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What brands of pruning tools do you carry at your store near Glenwood Springs?",
            "text": "<p>We stock trusted pruning tool brands that are known for durability and comfort. These include Corona, Fiskars, Zenport, and more, all available at our<a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Rivendell+Distribution,+Inc./data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xe31190bbf15ca07c?sa=X&ved=1t:2428&ictx=111\" target=\"_blank\"> store in Glenwood Springs, CO</a>. These tools are designed to meet the needs of garden care, orchard work, and trimming projects around homes in Carbondale. They’re also trusted by professional arborists for their quality, performance, and ease of use in both residential and commercial settings.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_fefCcQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the best tool to cut down branches?",
            "text": "<p>That depends on the size. For branches up to 2 inches thick, a strong lopper like the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/corona-dualcut-bypass-lopper-2-inch-max-forged?_pos=1&_sid=eca4d6dd4&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> Corona DualCUT Bypass Lopper</a> works well. For anything larger, a folding saw such as the Zenport Folding Saw 8.5-Inch or the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/products/corona-razortooth-folding-saw-10-inch-curved-blade?_pos=1&_sid=58ad0be78&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"> Corona RazorTOOTH Folding Saw</a> is a better fit. These tools are built for tough yard jobs and listed in our loppers and hand saws collections. Note that keeping your tools clean and sharp helps extend their life and makes every cut smoother.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_hCzz3i": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Should you trim dead branches off trees?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, removing dead branches helps keep your trees healthy and reduces the chance of breakage during storms. You can use pole pruners or cordless electric pruners to reach higher branches safely. Dead growth also blocks light and air circulation, so cleaning it up supports better plant health. After pruning, clearing debris and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/blogs/news/what-does-mulch-do-for-your-soil\" target=\"_blank\"> applying mulch</a> can also improve regrowth and soil quality.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_cfe7R3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you offer help choosing the right pruning tools for my next garden or tree project?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, we’re here to help! You may stop by our hardware center for<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/pruning-tools\" target=\"_blank\"> pruning tools</a> and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/tools-more\" target=\"_blank\"> outdoor supplies</a> in the Glenwood Springs area. Our team can guide you in choosing the<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/blogs/news/landscaping-tools-you-need-when-starting-your-business-in-colorado\" target=\"_blank\"> essential landscaping tools</a> based on your needs, whether you’re trimming small plants, cutting thick branches, or taking care of a larger yard. You’ll find a range of options in-store and online, and we’re happy to explain what works best for your setup.</p><p>If you prefer to browse online, just contact us for expert advice and we’ll arrange delivery straight to Carbondale, CO and surrounding areas. You can reach us by email at <a href=\"mailto:customerservice@rivendelldistribution.com\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>customerservice@rivendelldistribution.com</strong></a> or call us at <strong>(970) 945-2568</strong>.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
